recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the doorway guard now stands at a structural floor of 3, which makes it a gate on new writing rather than a ratchet, and it fires on tier cadence at a stranger's desk. Whether a pre-commit rule over this commit's staged pages alone should catch it at the author's desk is the narrow half of the %524 question, and eight ships run that file.
